      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Why this exists\nGmail requests no identity scope, so the stored OAuth token carries no email claim and n8n has nothing to report. `users.getProfile` is the only way to learn which Google account a caller connected.\n\nKept separate from the main workflow so the credentials page can ask without fetching anybody's mail.",
